<title>USA: Michigan Rivet Corp Q4 Oct 31 net, sales rise.</title>
<headline>Michigan Rivet Corp Q4 Oct 31 net, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, Mich. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended     Year Ended</p>
<p>				  October 31	   October 31</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net Sales     $11,758,779 $9,944,603 $41,596,542 $39,210,844</p>
<p> Net Income	  516,880    451,361   1,333,414   1,629,921</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share    .81	  .70	  2.09	  2.55</p>
<p>Michigan Rivet produces specialty fasteners for the automotive industry. Its manufacturing facilities are located in Warren and Petoskey, Mich.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
